  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "플라스마로 된 몸 덕분에\n가전제품에 들어갈 수 있는 포켓몬...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D50CB77CC2A4B9C8B85C0020B41C0020BAB80020B355BD84C5D0000AAC00C804C81CD488C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC080020C2180020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAAC002E002E002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 로토무랍니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020B85CD1A0BB34B78DB2C8B2E4002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신도 스마트로토무를 가지고 계시죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0B3C40020C2A4B9C8D2B8B85CD1A0BB34B97C0020AC00C9C0ACE00020ACC4C2DCC8E0003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로토무의 개체 수에 생산이 좌우되기 때문에\n스마트로토무는 매우 귀중하답니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CD1A0BB34C7580020AC1CCCB40020C218C5D00020C0DDC0B0C7740020C88CC6B0B418AE300020B54CBB38C5D0000AC2A4B9C8D2B8B85CD1A0BB34B2940020B9E4C6B00020ADC0C911D558B2F5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스마트로토무도 놀랍긴 하지만, 로토무의\n진면목은 가전제품에 들어갔을 때 나타나죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4B9C8D2B8B85CD1A0BB34B3C40020B180B78DAE340020D558C9C0B9CC002C0020B85CD1A0BB34C758000AC9C4BA74BAA9C7400020AC00C804C81CD488C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC14C7440020B54C0020B098D0C0B098C8E0002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다양한 가전제품에 들어가서 폼을 바꾸는\n로토무와 싸워 보시겠습니까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C591D55C0020AC00C804C81CD488C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC00C11C0020D3FCC7440020BC14AFB8B294000AB85CD1A0BB34C6400020C2F8C6CC0020BCF4C2DCACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다양한 폼을 가진 로토무와\n싸울 준비가 되셨다면 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C591D55C0020D3FCC7440020AC00C9C40020B85CD1A0BB34C640000AC2F8C6B80020C900BE44AC000020B418C168B2E4BA740020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로토무가 어떤 가전제품에 들어갈지\n벌써부터 궁금한데요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CD1A0BB34AC000020C5B4B5A40020AC00C804C81CD488C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC08C9C0000ABC8CC368BD80D1300020AD81AE08D55CB370C694002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다양한 폼을 가진 로토무와\n싸울 준비는 되셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C591D55C0020D3FCC7440020AC00C9C40020B85CD1A0BB34C640000AC2F8C6B80020C900BE44B2940020B418C168B098C694003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비됐어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44B410C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아직이요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C9C1C774C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "애태우지 마시고 로토무와 싸워 주시죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C560D0DCC6B0C9C00020B9C8C2DCACE00020B85CD1A0BB34C6400020C2F8C6CC0020C8FCC2DCC8E0002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로토무의 굉장하고 놀라운 특징!\n그것은 바로 가전제품과의 콜라보!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n우선 이 로토무부터 보시죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CD1A0BB34C7580020AD49C7A5D558ACE00020B180B77CC6B40020D2B9C9D50021000AADF8AC83C7400020BC14B85C0020AC00C804C81CD488ACFCC7580020CF5CB77CBCF4002100100001BE00000AC6B0C1200020C7740020B85CD1A0BB34BD80D1300020BCF4C2DCC8E0002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로토무가 어떤 가전제품에 들어갈지\n벌써부터 궁금한데요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CD1A0BB34AC000020C5B4B5A40020AC00C804C81CD488C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC08C9C0000ABC8CC368BD80D1300020AD81AE08D55CB370C694002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
