      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오븐레인지에 들어간 로토무는\n히트로토무라고 부른답니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624BE10B808C778C9C0C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC040020B85CD1A0BB34B294000AD788D2B8B85CD1A0BB34B77CACE00020BD80B978B2F5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "타입은 전기&불꽃!\n고스트타입이 사라졌네요!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0C0C785C7400020C804AE300026BD88AF430021000AACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785C7740020C0ACB77CC84CB124C6940021003F00100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오버히트라는 기술을 배울 수 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624BC84D788D2B8B77CB2940020AE30C220C7440020BC30C6B80020C2180020C788C8E0002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기분이 좋으면 바삭바삭하게 구워 주고!\n기분이 나쁘면 바싹 태워 버리겠네요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30BD84C7740020C88BC73CBA740020BC14C0ADBC14C0ADD558AC8C0020AD6CC6CC0020C8FCACE00021000AAE30BD84C7740020B098C058BA740020BC14C2F90020D0DCC6CC0020BC84B9ACACA0B124C694002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번 포켓몬 승부로...\n로토무의 장점을 보여 드리겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC880020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B85C002E002E002E000AB85CD1A0BB34C7580020C7A5C810C7440020BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
