      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "히트로토무의 열풍은\n어떠셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D788D2B8B85CD1A0BB34C7580020C5F4D48DC740000AC5B4B5A0C168B098C694003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음은! 세탁기에 들어간 로토무입니다!\n워시로토무라고 부르고 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC74000210020C138D0C1AE30C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC040020B85CD1A0BB34C785B2C8B2E40021000AC6CCC2DCB85CD1A0BB34B77CACE00020BD80B974ACE00020C788C8E0002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 굉장한데요!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020AD49C7A5D55CB370C6940021002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "워시로토무의 타입은\n전기&물!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6CCC2DCB85CD1A0BB34C7580020D0C0C785C740000AC804AE300026BB3C002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하이드로펌프를 배울 수 있다죠!\n참고로 저는 파도타기보다<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n하이드로펌프를 좋아한답니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C774B4DCB85CD38CD504B97C0020BC30C6B80020C2180020C788B2E4C8E00021000ACC38ACE0B85C0020C800B2940020D30CB3C4D0C0AE30BCF4B2E400100001BE00000AD558C774B4DCB85CD38CD504B97C0020C88BC544D55CB2F5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "세제가 없으면 세탁을 하지 않는\n사용자 친화적인 기능도 갖추고 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C138C81CAC000020C5C6C73CBA740020C138D0C1C7440020D558C9C00020C54AB294000AC0ACC6A9C7900020CE5CD654C801C7780020AE30B2A5B3C40020AC16CD94ACE00020C788C8E0002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "방을 물바다로 만들어 버릴 수도 있다는 점은\n주의해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC29C7440020BB3CBC14B2E4B85C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BC84B9B40020C218B3C40020C788B2E4B2940020C810C740000AC8FCC758D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
