      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "워시로토무의 물줄기는\n어떠셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6CCC2DCB85CD1A0BB34C7580020BB3CC904AE30B294000AC5B4B5A0C168B098C694003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음은! 잔디깎이에 들어간 로토무입니다!\n커트로토무라고 부르고 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC74000210020C794B514AE4EC774C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC040020B85CD1A0BB34C785B2C8B2E40021000ACEE4D2B8B85CD1A0BB34B77CACE00020BD80B974ACE00020C788C8E0002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와우! 놀라워라!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
