      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잔디깎이를 쓸 마당이 있는지부터가\n문제지만요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C794B514AE4EC774B97C0020C4F80020B9C8B2F9C7740020C788B294C9C0BD80D130AC00000ABB38C81CC9C0B9CCC694002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "깎은 잔디를 여기저기 흩뿌려 놓고\n으스대는 말썽꾸러기이기도 하죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE4EC7400020C794B514B97C0020C5ECAE30C800AE300020D769BFCCB8240020B193ACE0000AC73CC2A4B300B2940020B9D0C37DAFB8B7ECAE30C774AE30B3C40020D558C8E0002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커트로토무의 절삭력은\n어떠셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4D2B8B85CD1A0BB34C7580020C808C0ADB825C740000AC5B4B5A0C168B098C694003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음은! 선풍기에 들어간 로토무입니다!\n스핀로토무라고 부르고 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC74000210020C120D48DAE30C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC040020B85CD1A0BB34C785B2C8B2E40021000AC2A4D540B85CD1A0BB34B77CACE00020BD80B974ACE00020C788C8E0002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "판타스틱!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D310D0C0C2A4D2F10021002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스핀로토무의 타입은\n전기&비행!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D540B85CD1A0BB34C7580020D0C0C785C740000AC804AE300026BE44D589002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "에어슬래시를 배울 수 있답니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5D0C5B4C2ACB798C2DCB97C0020BC30C6B80020C2180020C788B2F5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기술을 지시하는 것처럼\n음성으로 조작할 수도 있다더군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C220C7440020C9C0C2DCD558B2940020AC83CC98B7FC000AC74CC131C73CB85C0020C870C791D5600020C218B3C40020C788B2E4B354AD70C694002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "중요한 서류를 날려 버리는\n장난꾸러기이기도 하죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C911C694D55C0020C11CB958B97C0020B0A0B8240020BC84B9ACB294000AC7A5B09CAFB8B7ECAE30C774AE30B3C40020D558C8E0002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스핀로토무의 풍력은\n어떠셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D540B85CD1A0BB34C7580020D48DB825C740000AC5B4B5A0C168B098C694003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마지막으로! 냉장고에 들어간 로토무입니다!\n프로스트로토무라고 부르고 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8C9C0B9C9C73CB85C00210020B0C9C7A5ACE0C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC040020B85CD1A0BB34C785B2C8B2E40021000AD504B85CC2A4D2B8B85CD1A0BB34B77CACE00020BD80B974ACE00020C788C8E0002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쏘 쿨~!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C3D80020CFE8007E002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "프로스트로토무의 타입은\n전기&얼음!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D504B85CC2A4D2B8B85CD1A0BB34C7580020D0C0C785C740000AC804AE300026C5BCC74C002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "눈보라를 배울 수 있답니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B208BCF4B77CB97C0020BC30C6B80020C2180020C788B2F5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냉기로 주위를 얼려 버리는 말썽꾸러기죠!\n...이건 어필할 만한 내용은 아닌 것 같네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0C9AE30B85C0020C8FCC704B97C0020C5BCB8240020BC84B9ACB2940020B9D0C37DAFB8B7ECAE30C8E00021000A002E002E002EC774AC740020C5B4D544D5600020B9CCD55C0020B0B4C6A9C7400020C544B2CC0020AC830020AC19B124C694002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "참고로 로토무의 폼체인지는\n특수한 모터와 관련이 있답니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC38ACE0B85C0020B85CD1A0BB34C7580020D3FCCCB4C778C9C0B294000AD2B9C218D55C0020BAA8D130C6400020AD00B828C7740020C788B2F5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로토무의 매력을 이야기하다 보니\n어느덧 승부가 끝나 버렸네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CD1A0BB34C7580020B9E4B825C7440020C774C57CAE30D558B2E40020BCF4B2C8000AC5B4B290B3670020C2B9BD80AC000020B05DB0980020BC84B838B124C694002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가라르지방에서는\n드론로토무나 로토무자전거 등<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n다방면으로 활약하고 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00B77CB974C9C0BC29C5D0C11CB294000AB4DCB860B85CD1A0BB34B0980020B85CD1A0BB34C790C804AC700020B4F100100001BE00000AB2E4BC29BA74C73CB85C0020D65CC57DD558ACE00020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로토무가 기본적으로\n장난을 좋아한다는 게 문제지만 말이죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CD1A0BB34AC000020AE30BCF8C801C73CB85C000AC7A5B09CC7440020C88BC544D55CB2E4B2940020AC8C0020BB38C81CC9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C8E0002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가전제품으로 제대로 쓰기는\n어려울지도 모르지만...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00C804C81CD488C73CB85C0020C81CB300B85C0020C4F0AE30B294000AC5B4B824C6B8C9C0B3C40020BAA8B974C9C0B9CC002E002E002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신이라면 다양한 폼의 로토무를\n배틀에서 활용하실 수 있을 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 4000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C774B77CBA740020B2E4C591D55C0020D3FCC7580020B85CD1A0BB34B97C000ABC30D2C0C5D0C11C0020D65CC6A9D558C2E40020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니, 로토무의 폼을 바꿀 수 있는\n카탈로그를 당신께 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 4084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C8002C0020B85CD1A0BB34C7580020D3FCC7440020BC14AFC00020C2180020C788B294000ACE74D0C8B85CADF8B97C0020B2F9C2E0AED80020B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야생 로토무를 잡으시거든\n카탈로그를 사용해 보세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 4168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CC0DD0020B85CD1A0BB34B97C0020C7A1C73CC2DCAC70B4E0000ACE74D0C8B85CADF8B97C0020C0ACC6A9D5740020BCF4C138C694002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다양한 기기나 가전제품이 개발될수록\n로토무도 그에 맞게 적응하지 않을까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 4236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C591D55C0020AE30AE30B0980020AC00C804C81CD488C7740020AC1CBC1CB420C218B85D000AB85CD1A0BB34B3C40020ADF8C5D00020B9DEAC8C0020C801C751D558C9C00020C54AC744AE4CC694003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로토무의 가능성은 무한하다는 거예요!\n그야말로 로토무 인피니티!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 4328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CD1A0BB34C7580020AC00B2A5C131C7400020BB34D55CD558B2E4B2940020AC70C608C6940021000AADF8C57CB9D0B85C0020B85CD1A0BB340020C778D53CB2C8D2F00021002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로토무카탈로그를 사용해서\n로토무의 폼을 바꿔 보셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CD1A0BB34CE74D0C8B85CADF8B97C0020C0ACC6A9D574C11C000AB85CD1A0BB34C7580020D3FCC7440020BC14AFD40020BCF4C168B098C694003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "언젠가 로토무가 온갖 가전제품에 들어가서\n어마어마한 장난을 치는 날이 올지도 몰라요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 4496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B8C820AC000020B85CD1A0BB34AC000020C628AC160020AC00C804C81CD488C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC00C11C000AC5B4B9C8C5B4B9C8D55C0020C7A5B09CC7440020CE58B2940020B0A0C7740020C62CC9C0B3C40020BAB0B77CC694002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "케테테~",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 4600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF00D14CD14C007E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
